    "show_runtime_semantics": "SIMD runtime found/not_found is constructed by iterating __cpu_dispatch__ and reading __cpu_features__[feature]; __cpu_features__, __cpu_baseline__, and __cpu_dispatch__ are distinct runtime objects."
