  "technical_interpretation": "V0.19 required every raw AVX-512 entry exposed through __cpu_features__ to become false. NumPy 1.26.4 runtime dispatch reporting instead treats __cpu_dispatch__ as the set of dispatchable non-baseline features and consults __cpu_features__ only for members of that set. Therefore residual raw capability bits are not, by themselves, evidence that AVX-512 runtime dispatch remains enabled. The V0.19 success criterion targeted the wrong observable. This diagnosis does not salvage V0.18R/V0.19 and does not inspect any failure-cell response.",
